message: "If you use Shared Sky, please cite it as below."
title: "Shared Sky: a pre-registered simulation of delivery drones and air taxis over Houston and Dallas-Fort Worth"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: forgottenl5
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24482589
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/forgottenl5/shared-sky"
url: "https://forgottenl5.github.io/shared-sky"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered simulation of Wing, Zipline and Amazon delivery drones flying
  their FAA-filed operations over Houston and Dallas-Fort Worth. Giving each
  company its own height cuts planned conflicts between companies by about 72 %
  (Houston) and 73 % (Dallas-Fort Worth). 81 registered studies; failed
  predictions are reported as failures.
keywords:
  - drones
  - delivery drones
  - airspace
  - UTM
  - simulation
  - pre-registration
